@startuml
title State Diagram - Pull Request Lifecycle

[*] --> Draft

Draft --> Open : mark ready for review
Open --> ChecksRunning : CI triggered
ChecksRunning --> ChecksPassed : success
ChecksRunning --> ChecksFailed : failure

ChecksFailed --> Open : push fixes
ChecksPassed --> UnderReview : reviewer opens PR

UnderReview --> ChangesRequested : reviewer requests changes
ChangesRequested --> Open : author pushes updates

UnderReview --> Approved : reviewer approves
Approved --> Merged : maintainer merges
Open --> Closed : author or maintainer closes

Merged --> [*]
Closed --> [*]

@enduml
